    rbo:publishedOn "2026-01-14T22:18:33+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rbo:rating 1 ;
    rbo:reviewText "I mean, definitely not the target audience but this is pretty much what pop hell sounds like to me in a way. It really is amazing in some ways how Stock Aitken Waterman thought that this severely 80s sound would still be \"trendy\" over a decade later..."@en ;
