    rbo:publishedOn "2021-01-05T11:37:16+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rbo:rating 3 ;
    rbo:reviewText "This review will be short, as I'm probably not educated well enough to fully comment on this album in a critical manner, however what I can say is that this album is better played back to front as the last 50% of the album (excluding the We Thuggin' remix) is comparatively much better than the first half; in regards to lyrics, flow, beats and features."@en ;
    rbo:reviewUrl "https://critiquebrainz.org/review/28a1d58c-da41-4db9-a720-dfa3b0ec4280"^^xsd:anyURI ;
