    rbo:publishedOn "2025-03-11T13:51:33+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rbo:rating 5 ;
    rbo:reviewText "Melodic post-rock/ambient album with electronic elements, recorded with members of Sigur Ros. It's a beatutiful journey. You feel like you are in the studio with them. It's not intensive, like Sigur Ros albums are. It's a very light album, very peaceful, but still melodic and capturing your attention. I had this on repeat on many ocasions and it didn't bore me at all, I could listen to it again and again and still find it interesting."@en ;
    rbo:reviewUrl "https://critiquebrainz.org/review/38169f55-0299-4b3b-adfd-db3430ec424a"^^xsd:anyURI ;
