    rbo:reviewText "An artist that everyone should listen to, if you like IDM but more warm and cozy this is it. Those melodies and atmospheric soundscapes with the interesting precisions are perfect to keep you mind very concentrating. Feels very good to listen to."@en ;
    rbo:reviewUrl "https://critiquebrainz.org/review/39280102-60df-4984-b256-b8339d3997d8"^^xsd:anyURI ;
