    rbo:rating 4 ;
    rbo:reviewText "The Second Studio Album of Fall Out Boy , It brings homebass with a basic and unique style of drumming, vocals, bass lines, and guitar parts. It was the first album to get a single to appear on the radio. I give it a four because it really gives me a good feel for music and I enjoy it. If I could I would give it a four and a half."@en ;
    rbo:reviewUrl "https://critiquebrainz.org/review/582bddbd-91f2-481b-adfa-1dd0154b8a84"^^xsd:anyURI ;
