    rbo:publishedOn "2026-01-16T16:36:14+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rbo:rating 1 ;
    rbo:reviewText """Genuinely terrible, and it goes on for over an hour. It's just some of the worst lyric writing I've heard and some of the compositions sound like someone dropping the sampler down the stairs.

The album should be named "sexually fustrated" as that would be more apt... if you don't believe me just have a listen to Come to Me...

just abhorrent."""@en ;
    rbo:reviewUrl "https://critiquebrainz.org/review/6be7c772-38cf-4803-aca5-1cbab3419ae9"^^xsd:anyURI ;
