    rbo:rating 2 ;
    rbo:reviewText "Maybe I'm just not in a very \"pop punk\" mood right now, but this album is kind of really middle the road for what it is. It's not unlistenable, but it just sounds like a really good tribute to blink-182."@en ;
    rbo:reviewUrl "https://critiquebrainz.org/review/6f750169-4c55-4f22-955e-259ae9b7e809"^^xsd:anyURI ;
