    rbo:publishedOn "2017-12-25T01:28:24+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rbo:reviewText "It is a thrilling song, with nice beats. I love the message the song carries. Some people can definitely relate to it. Also, the video is fun to watch. It's like an integration of music and a movie. Plus, the chorus is really catchy. I can't stop humming it"@en ;
    rbo:reviewUrl "https://critiquebrainz.org/review/7e9b1daa-d6a3-430b-9a37-9097cb2e9dc3"^^xsd:anyURI ;
