    rbo:reviewText """I've been on a bit thirsty for some good alternative country/americana stuff recently, and I was hoping that Harper Simon's self-titled debut might scratch that itch. Before you ask yourself, yes he is the son of Paul.

But sadly in the 30 minutes of this album there is rarely anything that really stands out as interesting."""@en ;
    rbo:reviewUrl "https://critiquebrainz.org/review/92a56274-620e-43f9-9b68-4251b0d74936"^^xsd:anyURI ;
