    rbo:reviewText "Personally has been my favorite band for a while now. Their songs *never* get boring! If you haven't heard their songs other than Spin Me, give them a listen because it's worth your time. R.I.P. Pete Burns and Steve Coy <3333"@en ;
    rbo:reviewUrl "https://critiquebrainz.org/review/fba922b2-8a49-44a8-9ced-58faa2b8137d"^^xsd:anyURI ;
